{"ref":"BDB, עַ֫יִר","hw":"עַ֫יִר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עַ֫יִר</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:16\" href=\"/Genesis.32.16\">Gn 32:16</a></sup> <strong>male ass</strong> (young and vigorous);—pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַעְיָרִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:16\" href=\"/Genesis.32.16\">Gn 32:16</a> (E); sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">עִירֹה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:11\" href=\"/Genesis.49.11\">49:11</a> (poem; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנִי אֲתֹנוֹ</span>); cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַיִר פֶּרֶא</span> (Ges<sup>§ 131 c N. 2</sup>; or appos. Kö<sup>Synt.§ 333 s</sup> Di al.) <a data-ref=\"Job 11:12\" href=\"/Job.11.12\">Jb 11:12</a> <em>wild ass’s colt;</em> pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲיָרִים</span>, for riding <a data-ref=\"Judges 10:4\" href=\"/Judges.10.4\">Ju 10:4a</a> (v <a data-ref=\"Judges 10:4\" href=\"/Judges.10.4\">4</a> b see ii. <a data-ref=\"BDB, עִיר³\" href=\"/BDB,_עִיר³\", dir=\"rtl\">עִיר</a>), <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲיָרִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 12:14\" href=\"/Judges.12.14\">12:14</a>, sg. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַיִר</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 9:9\" href=\"/Zechariah.9.9\">Zc 9:9</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲיָרִים</span> for carrying <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.6\">Is 30:6</a> Qr (Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">עורים</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲיָרִם</span> for tillage v <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:24\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.24\">24</a>.","next":"BDB, עִירָא","prev":"BDB, עיר"}